    "raw": "Questions about the Tenebrhae",
    "value": "有关影裔的疑问"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/contentPages/0",
    "raw": "Many are certain that the Novakid are fragments of the Cultivator, that ancient being responsible for seeding the cosmos with what we know and giving birth to all things. If this is the case, how do we explain the presence of the Tenebrhae? All tests seem to point to them being truly ancient in origin, and their very natures link them to the stuff of the cosmos as well.",
    "value": "许多人确信星之子是“耕耘者”的碎片，这位古老的存在曾将我们所知的万物播撒于宇宙，孕育众生。若果真如此，我们又该如何解释影裔的存在？所有测试都指向他们同样古老的起源，其本质亦与宇宙的本源紧密相连。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/contentPages/1",
    "raw": "Are they, then, some sort of anti-Novakid? A Yang to their Yin? The Shadow to their Light? I theorize that there are perhaps more things that predate all known life beyond just the Cultivator. Perhaps even a mate! Could such a thing be possible? Is there, somewhere among the stars, a female counterpart to the Cultivator?",
    "value": "难道他们是某种与星之子对立的存在？如同阴阳相生？暗影之于光明？我推测，或许在已知生命之前、在耕耘者之外，还存在更古老的存在。甚至可能有一位“伴侣”！这种事是否可能？繁星之中，是否会有一位与耕耘者对应的女性化身？"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/contentPages/2",
    "raw": "It would certainly make their notion of Mother more credible. Most think their Hive-like mental link is nothing more than a psionic connection that goes beyond all we know...but what if they are wrong and they are in fact communing with (or are pieces of) some massive and ancient power? Some sort of being that gave rise to all of the Darkness, while the Cultivator gave rise to Light?",
    "value": "这或许能让他们对“母亲”的信仰更具说服力。多数人认为他们蜂巢般的精神连接不过是超越认知的灵能链接...但若他们错了呢？若他们实际正在与某种庞大古老的力量交流（或是其碎片）？正如耕耘者孕育光明，是否也存在一个引生一切黑暗的存在？"
  }
]